1
00:00:00,087 --> 00:00:02,927
(Penny:)- Our soup of the day...
- You must release me from my oath.

2
00:00:06,218 --> 00:00:08,598
(Penny:)Sheldon, I'm working.

3
00:00:08,763 --> 00:00:10,763
Why don't you take a minute to decide?

4
00:00:12,933 --> 00:00:14,393
(Sheldon:)I can't keep your secret, Penny.

5
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:19,110
I'm going to fold like an energy-based
de novo protein in conformational space.

6
00:00:20,066 --> 00:00:21,486
(Sheldon:)Like a Renaissance triptych.

7
00:00:22,443 --> 00:00:24,363
(Sheldon:)Like a cheap suit.

8
00:00:24,654 --> 00:00:27,694
(Penny:)Look, why is it so hard
for you to keep one little secret?

9
00:00:27,865 --> 00:00:29,405
(Sheldon:)I'm constitutionally incapable.

10
00:00:29,575 --> 00:00:33,205
(Sheldon:)That's why I was refused clearance
for a government research fellowship...

11
00:00:33,371 --> 00:00:36,871
(Sheldon:)...at a secret military supercollider
beneath a fake agricultural station...

12
00:00:37,041 --> 00:00:40,331
...12.5 miles southeast
of Traverse City, Michigan.

13
00:00:45,132 --> 00:00:48,092
(Sheldon:)Which you did not hear about from me.

14
00:00:48,594 --> 00:00:51,474
(Penny:)Look, just forget I told you about me...

15
00:00:51,639 --> 00:00:53,769
(Penny:)...not graduating
from community college, okay?

16
00:00:53,933 --> 00:00:57,933
Forget? You want me to forget?
This mind does not forget.

17
00:00:58,104 --> 00:01:03,024
I haven't forgotten a thing since the day
my mother stopped breastfeeding me.

